# FANET Vario was published as /devices/fbfanetvario before the SKU was renamed
# to fbfv (the name the device itself reports in DIS). Keep the old address
# alive — it may have been linked or indexed. Must stay ABOVE the SPA fallback.
/devices/fbfanetvario      /devices/fbfv            301
/devices/fbfanetvario/*    /devices/fbfv/:splat     301
/update/firmware/fbfanetvario  /update/firmware/fbfv  301

# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback — every unmatched path serves index.html with
# a 200 so the Vue client router can resolve the route on hydration.
/*  /index.html  200
